      "text": "Surgical extraction completed without complication. Flap reflected; tooth sectioned for removal; vertical root fracture confirmed intraoperatively. Socket curetted and irrigated, then prepared for immediate implant placement (see the D6010 implant Procedure at the same encounter). Local anesthesia: inferior alveolar nerve block + long buccal block, 2% lidocaine with 1:100,000 epinephrine."
